   "_id": 9363,
   "ANSWER": "<p>A SQL query like <code data-end=\"3936\" data-start=\"3874\">SELECT * FROM Students WHERE score &gt; 85 AND subject = &#39;Math&#39;</code> specifies the desired result directly without manual control structures.</p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC203P",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1",
    "PLO2"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>A report must retrieve students who scored above 85% in Math. How does declarative programming support this task?</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 108,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 9363
  },
  {
   "_id": 9364,
   "ANSWER": "<p>A <code data-end=\"4137\" data-start=\"4127\">GROUP BY</code> query aggregates results based on regions, allowing simple and effective extraction of summary data without imperative code.</p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC203P",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1",
    "PLO2"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>A company needs to summarize sales per region. How can declarative processing achieve this?</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 108,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 9364
  }
 ],
 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 9381,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"3359\" data-start=\"3183\">SELECT student_id<br />\nFROM marks<br />\nGROUP BY student_id<br />\nHAVING MIN(score) &gt; 90;</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li data-end=\"5311\" data-start=\"5243\">\n\t<p data-end=\"5311\" data-start=\"5245\">The query expresses <strong data-end=\"5273\" data-start=\"5265\">what</strong> is needed, not <strong data-end=\"5296\" data-start=\"5289\">how</strong> to compute it.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"5380\" data-start=\"5312\">\n\t<p data-end=\"5380\" data-start=\"5314\">Declarative programming abstracts away iteration and control flow.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"5477\" data-start=\"5381\">\n\t<p data-end=\"5477\" data-start=\"5383\">The database engine optimizes execution internally, promoting <strong data-end=\"5456\" data-start=\"5445\">clarity</strong> and <strong data-end=\"5476\" data-start=\"5461\">conciseness</strong>.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC203P",
   "LEVEL": 3,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1",
    "PLO2"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p data-end=\"613\" data-start=\"371\">A school system requires a list of students who scored above 90 in <strong data-end=\"5030\" data-start=\"5014\">all subjects</strong>. Provide an SQL query for this and explain how the <strong data-end=\"5106\" data-start=\"5082\">declarative paradigm</strong> simplifies the task.</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 108,
   "TYPE": "lq",
   "key": 9381
  }
 ]
